.TH KUMIDLE 1 "2026" "kumde 0.8.0" "KumDE Manual"
.SH NAME
kumidle \- idle and DPMS manager for KumDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kumidle
[\fBoptions\fR]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --idle-s \fIn\fR
Seconds of inactivity before idle command runs (default: 300).
.TP
.B --lock-s \fIn\fR
Seconds before screen lock (default: 310).
.TP
.B --dpms-s \fIn\fR
Seconds before displays turn off (default: 330).
.TP
.B --lock-cmd \fIcmd\fR
Command to run on lock (default: kumlock).
.TP
.B --idle-cmd \fIcmd\fR
Command to run on idle.
.TP
.B --resume-cmd \fIcmd\fR
Command to run on resume from idle.
.SH NOTES
Requires the compositor to support ext-idle-notify-v1.
